#~ "From the anthemic “<strong>Hey Jude</strong>” to the psychedelic swirl of "
#~ "“<strong>Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds</strong>”, and the raw emotion of "
#~ "“<strong>Let It Be</strong>”, this concert is a journey through the "
#~ "soundtrack of generations. With dazzling visuals, vintage flair, and "
#~ "state-of-the-art sound, the band will revisit their most beloved albums – "
#~ "from <em>Rubber Soul</em> to <em>Abbey Road</em> – and remind us all why "
#~ "they changed the world, one chord at a time."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Fra den hymneagtige \"<strong>Hey Jude</strong>\" over den psykedeliske "
#~ "hvirvel i \"<strong>Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds</strong>\" til de "
#~ "intense følelser i \"<strong>Let It Be</strong>\" er denne koncert en "
#~ "rejse gennem generationers soundtrack. Med imponerende visuals, vintage-"
#~ "flair og den nyeste lydteknologi genopliver bandet sine mest populære "
#~ "albums – fra <em>Rubber Soul</em> til <em>Abbey Road</em> – og minder os "
#~ "om, hvorfor de har ændret verden, akkord for akkord."

